  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Post-Earthquake Economic Recovery Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to support the economic recovery of earthquake-affected industrial firms in various sectors and thereby contribute to enhancing the resilience of the productivity and economic growth of the country. The Project will also support the country&#x2019;s preparedness for adapting to climate change and the promotion of circular economy, both of which will be of need to better manage future external shocks. The Project Development Objective (PDO) is to support the economic resilience, recovery and productivity enhancement of earthquake-affected firms in various sectors of T&#xfc;rkiye&#x2019;s economy.</narrative>
  </description>
